pan>&nbsp;</span><span style="color:#023474;font-weight:700">Manchester United</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;&mdash; 71 pts, +19</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700">4.</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span style="color:#023474;font-weight:700">Aston Villa</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;&mdash; 65 pts, +7</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span style="font-weight:700">5.</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span style="color:#023474;font-weight:700">Liverpool</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;&mdash; 60 pts, +10</span></p><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.0;text-align:left"><span>Arsenal&#39;s 85 points ended a 22-year wait. Runners-up in the Champions League: 1-1 after extra time against </span><span style="color:#023474;font-weight:700">Paris Saint-Germain</span><span>&nbsp;at the Pusk&aacute;s Ar&eacute;na in Budapest on May 30 &mdash; </span><span style="font-weight:700">Kai Havertz</span><span>&nbsp;inside six minutes, </span><span style="font-weight:700">Ousmane Demb&eacute;l&eacute;</span><span>&nbsp;from the spot on the hour &mdash; and beaten 4-3 on penalties, </span><span style="font-weight:700">Gabriel</span><span>&nbsp;missing the last. </span><span style="font-weight:700">Mikel Arteta</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-f